<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 PE Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Petiri</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Petiri</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petiri</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petiri</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="im">Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Petiri iyandikighwa na mtumighwa Petiri. Petiri kanza ibaluwa yake kwa kulonga yeye yali nani na kolonga ibaluwa yake kamwandikila nani. Kawandikila Wakiristu wose iwali “wagheni” muisi mno (1 Petiri 1:1). Mala nyingi tsakawakema apfo iwanu yang'ali yowandikila. Kwaapfila ibaluwa yake ino yeghala na ibaluwa iyandike Pauli kwa iwanu wa Efeso, iwanu wengi wotoghola ka ibaluwa kwa iwanu wa Efeso ilongola kwandikighwa kubita ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Petiri iyandikighwe mna miyaka ya sitini na tano kulawa Yesu helekighwe. Petiri kandika ibaluwa ino hayang'ali Roma, isi iyaikemile Babuloni (5:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chinu chikulu ghendo chimtendile Petiri yandike ibaluwa ino kuwaghuma ghumoyo na kuwalongela uluso wa kweli we Imulungu (5:12). Mbuli nyingi itsili mne ibaluwa ino ya Petiri ka 1 Petiri 2:11-3:7, yeghala ghendo na mbuli itsili mne ibaluwa kwa Waefeso 5:18-6:9, na Wakolosai 3:18-4:6. Imistali yose ayo yolonga mbuli tsa iwanu ukukala pfinoghile ne iwanu wangi na iwanu wa mmakaye mwawo, na kuwahulikitsa iwatawala. Pfipfila Petiri kowaghuma ghumoyo wakiristu wadudumile ahala hawoghaya kwaapfila ghamatsuwa gha habehi kumala. (4:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-2, Petiri kolonga yeye yali nani.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:3-2:10, komlongela Imulungu mighede kwa ukombotsi iwali nawo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 2:11-4:11, Petiri kolaghitsa ukukala ghoya, kolonga iwanu pfawabamighwa kukala, ka immale na pinga wake, imtumwa na mtwatsa wake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 4:12-5:11, kolonga Wakiristu pfawobamighwa kukala hala hawodununzika.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 5:12-14, Petiri komalitsila ibaluwa yake</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene Petiri mtumighwa wa Yesu Kiristu, nomwandikilani mwemwe imsaghulighwe ne Imulungu, yampwililike na kukala ka wahenza ako Ponto, Galatiya, Kapadokiya, Asiya na Bisiniya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imulungu Aba tsakawamanya mwemwe na kamsaghulani kulawa ghumwande, na Ghumuhe wake kawatenda mwenzeluke, mdahe kumuhulikitsa Yesu Kiristu na kumitsighwa idamu yake.</para>
  <para style="p">Nomlomba Imulungu yawongetsele uluso wake na yamwikeni tseghamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Lolelo line ngupfu lya ghamatsuwa ghose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekani tumtunye Imulungu, Aba wa Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu. Kwaapfila katwonela libatsi sideke kwa kututenda twelekighwe keli kwa kutsilihuka kwa Yesu Kiristu. Mbuli ino yotwing'a lolelo line ngupfu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Namwe mwololela kubokela pfinu pfinoghile pfang'apfidaha bae kulala, kuhinyika wala kufinala. Imulungu kamwikilani kulanga pfinu apfo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Namwe mwololesighwa ne ingupfu ye Imulungu kubitila ukutoghola mbaka mpate ukombotsi yawikile Imulungu kwa kughubulighwa mne ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Muideng'elele imbuli ino, hata ka sambi, kwa chipindi chidodo mwobamighwa mghanzike kwaajili ya ukughetsighwa sideke. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Agho ghobama kughetsa ukutoghola kwenu kulangusa ka kunogha. Hata nzahabu, iidaha kuhinyika nayo yoghetsighwa ne ghumoto, lelo ukutoghola kwenu chinu chikulu kubita nzahabu, pfipfila kwobamighwa kughetsighwe. Baho mtsotunyighwa, mtsotunitsighwa na mtsotogholighwa ne Imulungu kwa ukutoghola kwenu mne litsuwa lila Yesu Kiristu hatsakutsa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hata ka ng'ammwonile bae, mwomnoghela, na hata ka sambi ng'ammwona, mwemwe mwomtoghola na mmemesighwa ndeng'elo ya utunitso ing'aidaha bae kulongighwa, <verse number="9" style="v"/>kwaapfila mwobokela ghweko lya ukutoghola kwenu, iwo ukombotsi wenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Manabii tsawatabili mbuli tsa uluso uno ka ung'awatsileni mwemwe, kuya tsawapelemba ng'ani na kwighutsaghutsa mbuli tsa ukombotsi uno. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tsawabama wamanye ichipindi chachi na itsakuwatse kwa chinu acho ichilongighwe ne Ghumuhe wa Kiristu iyakalile mghati mwawo, iyalanguse Kiristu pfayatsoghaya ne utunitso iukutsa hambele. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imulungu kawaghubulila manabii ka ng'awesang'anile iwenyegho bae, ila wawasang'anilani mwemwe, hala hawalongile mbuli tsino tsamlongelighwe sambi ne iwanu wala iwawapetele Imbuli Inoghile kwa ngupfu ye Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iyatumighwe ne Imulungu kulawa kulanga. Hata wamalaika wosulukila kumanya mbuli tsino.</para>
  <para style="s">Mkale kwa uwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo, mwiyandae ghendo na mkale meso, mwilongotse wenyegho. Mwike lolelo lyenu mne uluso wamtsakwing'ighwa hayatsoghubulighwa Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Muwe ka iwana iwohulika, mleke kukala kwa kuwinza keli tsitamaa tsihile ka hala hamkalile ng'ammanyile ukweli we Imulungu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bali ka yula yawakemile pfahenzeluke, namwe mwenzeluke mna ghose ghamtenda, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kwaapfila yandikighwa mne Ghamaandiko, “Mwenzeluke, kwaapfila Nene nihenzeluka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hamumlomba Imulungu, mwomkema Aba, mmanye ka yeye komuhigha chila munu ka pfayatendile, Imulungu ng'obaghula bae, apfo mkale muisi mno ka iwahenza kwa kumpfuka Imulungu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwomanya tsamkombolighwa mne aghala ghehile ighambokele kulawa kwe iwabala wenu. Ng'amkombolighwe bae kwa ipfinu ipfihinyika ka fetsa au nzahabu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ila kwa idamu ya Kiristu iuli chinu chikulu, imwana we ing'olo iyalihela chilema au ng'opfu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tsakasaghulighwa ne Imulungu ng'ana isi ilumbighwe, lekeni kaghubulighwa mne ghamatsuwa ghano ghe ukutsigha kwaajili yenu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kubitila yeye mwomtoghola Imulungu, iyamtsilihule na iyamtunyile, apfo ukutoghola kwenu na lolelo lyenu pfa kwe Imulungu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lelo mdeghetesighwa muhe kwa kuhulikitsa ukweli ili muwanoghele ndughu tsenu bila ung'enye, mwinoghele mwemwe kwa mwemwe kwa ghumoyo ghose. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwemwe mwing'ighwa ughima wa sambi, si kwa mbeghu iikola bae, ila kwa mbeghu ing'aikola, kwa nzila ye usenga we Imulungu une ughima na iukala. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Iwanu wose weghala ne imitsani</para>
  <para style="q">na utunitso wawo weghala na ghamaluwa gha kumuhulo.</para>
  <para style="q">Imitsani yonyala na ghamaluwa gholaghala,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>lekeni usenga we Imtwatsa itsakwima ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="m">Mbuli ayo iyo Imbuli Inoghile yampetighwe.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Libwe lya ughima na iwanu wahenzeluke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Apfo mghaleke ghose ghehile na ughutsu na ung'enye na chepfu na ukwilonga pfihile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwighale ne iwana wadowado, iwelekighwe sambi pfawosulukila kong'a ghamatombo, namwe msulukile matombo ghanoghile igholawa mne Imbuli ye Imulungu, ili mkule na ukukombolighwa, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ka kweli mmanya Imtwatsa ka mluso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mghendeleni Imtwatsa, yeye ka libwe lye ughima ililemighwe ne iwanu, lekeni lisaghulighwa ne Imulungu ka libwe linoghile kuna yeye. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe, mumghendele ka ghamabwe gha ughima, imkatsengighwe muwe ing'anda ye chimuhe na kuwa watambika wahenzeluka, kwa kulapfa nambiko tsa muhe itsitogholighwa ne Imulungu kubitila Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Lola, nakwika libwe ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q">libwe kulu lya ghumsingi lya hane membe, ilisaghulighwe na libwe linoghile.</para>
  <para style="q">Munu wowose iyomtoghola ng'atsoghelighwa chinyala bae.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lelo kuna mwemwe yamtoghola, libwe lino linogha. Lekeni kwa iwanu yang'awotoghola, ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga, “Libwe ililemighwe ne iwanu iwotsenga, liwa libwe kulu lya ghumsingi lya hane membe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>kuya gholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Libwe alyo libwe lya ukwikwala iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q">na libambalawe lya ukuwaghwisa iwanu.”</para>
  <para style="m">Iwanu wekwala kwaapfila ng'awaitoghola bae imbuli ila, apfi pfipfo pfawekelighwe kulawa ghumwande.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mwa iwanu imsaghulighwe, watambika wa Mndewa, kingili lye iwanu wahenzeluka, iwanu we Imulungu mwenyegho, iyamsaghulighwe kutsipeta sang'ano ng'ulu tse Imulungu iyawakemile kulawa mchisi mwingile mne ghumwanga ghwake ighukangawatsa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ghumwande mwemwe ng'amkalile bae iwanu we Imulungu, lekeni sambi mwemwe mwa iwanu wake, ghamatsuwa agho ng'ambokele bae libatsi lyake, lekeni sambi mbokela libatsi lyake.</para>
  <para style="s">Mkale ka iwatumwa we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wandughu tsangu, nowalombani, mwemwe ka iwahenza na iwabita nzila hano muisi, mtsileke tsitamaa tsihile itsitowa ne muhe tsenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mkale ghoya mghati mwe iwanu ing'awommanya Imulungu, hata ka watsowaghutsukilani mtenda ghehile, hawatsoghona ghamatendo ghenu, watsomtunya Imulungu mne litsuwa lyatsakutsa kuwahigha iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wahulikitseni iwanu wane ukulu kwaajili ya Imtwatsa, mumuhulikitse imndewa iyali mtawala mkulu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>au iwakulu iwasaghulighwe naye kuwahigha iwanu wala iwotenda ghehile na kuwatunya iwanu iwotenda ghanoghile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imulungu kobama kubitila mwemwe kutenda ghanoghile, muwatende iwanu wabotsi waleke kulonga mbuli ng'awatsimanyile bae. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mkale ka iwanu iweyanzale, lekeni mleke kutumila ukwiyanzala kwenu ka chibangitsilo cha kutenda ghehile, mkale ka iwatumwa we Imulungu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mleke kumbetsa munu wowose, muwanoghele Wakiristu wayenu, mumpfuke Imulungu na mleke kumbetsa imndewa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghumfano wa ukudununzika kwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mwemwe iwatumwa muwahulikitse watwatsa wenu kwa kuwapfuka, si awala iwanoghile ne iwahole waliheka, ila hata awala iwali wakali. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mana Imulungu katsombalikini mng'adudumila ghamaghayo ghang'ambamighwe bae mghaye kwaapfila mwomwalangula Imulungu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Angu mtsopata choni kwa kududumila ukutowighwa kwa matotso ghamtenda? Lekeni ka mwoghanzika kwa kutenda ghanoghile na mwodudumila, Imulungu katsombalikini. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Agho ghagho ghamkemelighwe, kwaapfila Kiristu tsakawadununzikilani mwemwe, kamlekeleni ghumfano, apfo mtende ka pfatendile yeye. <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Ng'atendile nzambi bae, wala ng'ana yalonge ughutsu bae.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hawamlighile, yeye ng'awalighile bae, hawamdununze, yeye ng'awatendile wapfuke bae, ila kamlolela Imulungu iyohigha ghoya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kiristu imwenyegho kabapa nzambi tsetu mlukuli mwake mna msalaba ili tuleke kutenda nzambi na tukale kwa ukumnoghelesa Imulungu. Kwa pfilonda pfake mwemwe muhonetsighwa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwemwe tsamkala ka iwang'olo iwaghile, lekeni sambi mmuyila Imdimi na Mbetetsi wa ughima wenu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwamale ne wehe tsawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pfipfila mwemwe wehe muwahulikitse iwamale tsenu, ka wabaho iwamale yang'awoitoghola imbuli ye Imulungu, watoghole kwa ukwona pfamtenda, hata bila kuwalongela mbuli, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kwaapfila watsowona pfamkala ghoya na kwa kuhulikitsa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mleke kwihamba kwa kunze kuliheka, ka kusuka tsimvili tsa ukugholija na kupfala nzahabu na ghamaghwanda gha bei ng'ulu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lekeni kwihamba kwenu kuwe mghati mwe ghumoyo, ukunogha ing'akuhinyika bae, ghumoyo ighunoghile na ighuholile, acho chinu chikulu kwe Imulungu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwaapfila apfi pfipfo pfawehambile iwapinga wenzeluka wa ghumwande, awala iwamlolele Imulungu. Tsawehamba kwa kuwahulikitsa iwamale tsawo, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ka Sara pfayamuhulikitse Abrahamu na kumkema mndewa wake. Mwemwe mwa iwanaghe ka mwotenda ghanoghile bila kughelighwa wogha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe iwamale mkale ne iwapinga wenu aku mwomanya ka wawo wanyonge kubita mwemwe, apfo mleke kuwabetsa, muwatendele pfinoghile, kwaapfila mtsobokela nawo ghweko lya ughima lye Imulungu. Mng'atenda apfo kuduhu chinu ichitsoghoma aghala ighamlomba.</para>
  <para style="s">Kudununzika kwa kutenda ghanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya nomalitsila kwa kulonga pfino, muwe na ghumoyo ghumwe, mwiyonele libatsi, mwinoghele ka mwa wandughu, muwe wahole na wenyepfale. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mleke kuliha lihile kwa lihile au ligho kwa ligho, lekeni muwabaliki, kwaapfila mwemwe tsamkemighwa ne Imulungu ili mbalikiighwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfogholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Imunu wowose iyonoghela ughima na kwona ghamatsuwa ghanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q">mlomo wake uleke kulonga ghehile na lulimi lwake luleke kulonga ughutsu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aleke kutenda ghehile na atende ghanoghile</para>
  <para style="q">kuya kobamighwa yabame tindiwalo kwa ghumoyo ghose.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nenge tse Imtwatsa tsowalola ghoya iwanu iwomnoghelesa yeye</para>
  <para style="q">na maghutwi ghake ghowategheletsa ghoya hawolomba.</para>
  <para style="q">Lekeni Imtwatsa koweng'a chisogho awala iwotenda ghehile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yuhi yatsowalagha ka mwobama ghendo kutenda ghanoghile? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni hata ka mwoghaya kwa kutenda ighomnoghelesa Imulungu, mbweda! Mleke kumpfuka imunu wowose, mleke kughanzika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni mumtegheletse Kiristu mwenzeluka ka Imtwatsa mne mimoyo yenu. Ghamatsuwa ghose mwiyandae kuwedika iwoghutsa mbuli tse lolelo ilili mne mimoyo yenu. Lekeni mtende pfino kwa kuhola na kwa kupfuka, <verse number="16" style="v"/>bila mimoyo yenu kuwalongela ka mtotsa, ili hamlighighwa, iwanu wala iwalongile ghehile kwa ghamatendo ghenu ighanoghile mne ukwilunga na Kiristu, wone chinyala. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ng'apfu kughaya kwa kutenda ghanoghile ka yomnogheletsa Imulungu, kubita kughaya kwa kutenda ghehile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Kiristu naye tsakadununzika na kufa mala lumwe kwa nzambi tse iwanu wose, imunu iyomnoghelesa Imulungu kawafila iwanu ing'awomnoghela Imulungu ili yawaghale mwemwe kwe Imulungu. Tsakakomighwa kwa ulukuli ila katendighwa mghima kwa muhe, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kwa muhe pfipfila tsakaghenda kuwapetela muhe itsili mchifungo, <verse number="20" style="v"/>awo iwo iwalemile kumuhulikitsa Imulungu hayawabetile kwa kududumila ghamatsuwa ghala gha Nuhu hayang'ali yotsenga safina. Mne safina ayo tsawakala iwanu chidogho ghendo, iwanu wanane waliyeka, iwakombolighwe mmatsi, <verse number="21" style="v"/>na ghamatsi ghano gholangusa ubatitso iumkombolani mwemwe sambi. Si kuleghusa dikwe mlukuli, ila laghano ilitendighwa kwa ghumoyo ing'aghulonga bae mtotsa hambele he Imulungu, kubitila kutsilihuka kwa Yesu Kiristu, <verse number="22" style="v"/>iyaghendile kulanga na kukala lubali lwa kujilo lwa Imulungu, na wamalaika, iwakulu na iwane ngupfu wa hasi hake.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ughima wa sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Kiristu tsakadununzika mlukuli mwake, namwe pfipfila muwe na chinu chichila chayalangule, kwaapfila ayula iyadununzike mlukuli, ng'elunga bae ne nzambi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kulawa sambi, ughima wenu iusighale hano muisi, mkale ka pfayobama Imulungu na si ka pfambama wenyegho bae. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ghumwande tsamkala na matsuwa mengi gha kutenda aghala ghawotenda iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu, tsamkala iwanu waghoni, mwosulukila pfihile, mwopatika, mwotenda pfihungo ipfamkunwa ng'ani na kutenda pfinu pfa chinyala na kutambikila ipfinyagho, ipfili chinu cha kuhila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sambi iwanu awo ing'awammanyile Imulungu wokangawala kwaapfila ng'amwilongotsa nawo keli mne kutenda ghehile, apfo womlighani. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni wana mbuli yo ukwidika kwe Imulungu, baho hayatsowahigha iwanu waghima ne iwafile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwaajili ayo Imbuli Inoghile tsaipetelighwa hata kwe iwanu iwafile, ili wahighighwe mlukuli ka pfawohighighwa iwanu wangi, wakale mne muhe ka pfayobama Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Tutumile ghoya ghatwing'ighwe ne Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ukumala kwa pfinu pfose kwahabehi. Apfo mwalangitse, mkale meso ili mdahe kulomba. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kubita ghose, mwinoghele ng'ani mwemwe kwa mwemwe, kwaapfila unoghelo ughubikagha nzambi nyingi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwibokele kwa uluso mwemwe kwa mwemwe mmakaye mwenu bila kunung'unika. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chila munu yatumile achila chayagholelighwe ne Imulungu kuwapfila wanu wangi, ka mwimilitsi yanoghile mna tsawadi tsinoghile tse Imulungu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'alonga, mbuli tsake tsiwe ka tsa Imulungu. Imunu wowose ang'atumikila, atende kwa ngupfu tsayeng'ighwe ne Imulungu, ili Imulungu yatunyighwe kubitila Yesu Kiristu mna ghose. Kuna yeye Imulungu wolawa utunitso ne ngupfu ghamatsuwa ghose ghendo. Amina.</para>
  <para style="s">Kudununzika kwa kuwa mkiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sale tsangu, mleke kukangawala kwa maghetso gha usungu ighampata, ka apfila ichinu ichimlawilani chigheni. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni mdeng'elele kwaapfila tsamghaya ka Kiristu pfayaghayile, ili hautsoghubulighwa utunitso wake mdeng'elele ghendo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mng'alighighwa kwaapfila mwomuwinza Kiristu, deng'eleleni, kwaapfila Ghumuhe we utunitso we Imulungu kokala namwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ka kwoghanzika, uleke kughanzika kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa imunu iyokoma, mbapfi au imunu iyotenda ghehile au yakwingilila mbuli tse iwanu wangi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni ka kwodununzika kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa Mkiristu, uleke kwona chinyala, ila umtunitse Imulungu kwa kukemighwa kwa taghwa lya Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila chipindi cha kuhigha chipfika, na chakwandusa ne iwanu we Imulungu, na ka chakwandusa na twetwe, itsakuwatse kwe iwanu wala yang'awotegheletsa Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ka pfikomu kwa imunu iyomnoghelesa Imulungu kukombolighwa,</para>
  <para style="q">itsokuwatse kwe imunu yang'ompfuka Imulungu na iyane nzambi?”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfo iwanu wala iwodununzika ka pfayobama Imulungu, wamuhuwile Mulumba wawo iyotogholighwa na waghendelele kutenda ghanoghile.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kwe iwabala ne iwasongolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwe iwabala, nene imbala miyenu iyanimwonile Yesu Kiristu pfayadununzike na yanitselunga mne utunitso ula iutsoghubulighwa, nowalombani ghendo, <verse number="2" style="v"/>muwe iwadimi we kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu imuwalolesa, muwalongotse si kwa kunanaitsighwa, ila kwaapfila mwobama muwenyegho na ka Imulungu pfayobama. Msang'ane si kwaajili ya sendi, ila kwa ghumoyo ghwose, <verse number="3" style="v"/>mleke kuwatawala kwa ngupfu, ila muwe chinu cha kwighighwa kuna kingili alyo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naye Imdimi Imkulu hayatsolawila, mtsobokela ghweko lya utunitso ing'alikwaghitsa bae ukunogha kwake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe iwasongolo muwahulikitse iwabala wenu, mwemwe wose muwe wahole mna ukwisang'anila, kwaapfila Ghamaandiko gholonga, “Imulungu kowalema iwanu iweghoda, ila kowatendela uluso iwanu yang'aweghoda.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mwihulumse hane ghumoko ghwa Imulungu ghune ngupfu, ili yawenule mne chipindi chinoghile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwasileni Yeye ghose ghamghanzika, kwaapfila yeye kowatunzani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwalangitse na mkale meso, kwaapfila Yehile iyomwihilani kakwangakwanga ka simba iyoduma iyobama imunu yamje. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mbeleleni, mwime ghoya mne ukutoghola, kwaapfila mwomanya Wakiristu wayenu mne isi yose wodununzika ka pfamdununzika mwemwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni mng'amalitsa kudununzika kwa chipindi chidodo, Imulungu yane uluso wose, iyawakemile mwingile mne utunitso wake wa ghamatsuwa ghose mne ukwilunga na Kiristu, yeye imwenyegho katsomtendani muwe waghima keli, katsomwing'ani ingupfu, katsowatenda mwime ghoya na kumwing'eni ghumsingi ighunoghile. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yeye yaliheka yane ngupfu ghamatsuwa ghose ghendo. Amina.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndamso tsa ukumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Niwandikilani ibaluwa ino ndodo kwa kwapfilighwa na Silivani, nomwona yeye ka ndughu yangu mtogholighwa. Nobama kuwaghumani imimoyo na kuwalongela ka chinu chino uluso we Imulungu wa kweli. Mwime ghoya mne uluso awo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wakiristu wayenu iwali Babeli, iwasaghulighwe hamwe namwe, womlamsani. Naye Maliki, iyali ka mwanangu komlamsani. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwilamse kwa ukwinoghela. Mkale tseghamba mwemwe wose imli mghati mwa Kiristu.</para>
</usx>
